{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Sociaal-economisch panel onderzoek - SEP - 1984  t\/m 2002"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"P1663"}},{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:39776"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek"},"authorAffiliation":{"typeName":"authorAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"https:\/\/ror.org\/0408v4c28","expandedvalue":{"scheme":"http:\/\/www.grid.ac\/ontology\/","@type":"https:\/\/schema.org\/Organization"}}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"C.B.S.  Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Doel:<br>Meten van allerlei aspecten van welvaart, hun onderlinge samenhang en veranderingen in de loop van de tijd naar inkomen, bezit en schulden, waardering van inkomen, arbeid, duurzame goederen, wonen, attitudes en wensen.<\/p><p>Doelpopulatie:<br>Particuliere huishoudens in Nederland.<\/p><p>Nettosteekproefomvang:<br>Circa 5 000 huishoudens.<\/p><p>Steekproefeenheid:<br>Persoon en huishouden.<\/p><p>Berichtgevers:<br>Iedere persoon van 16 jaar of ouder in het huishouden plus één persoon voor variabelen die betrekking hebben op het huishouden als geheel.<\/p><p>Dit beteft een beveiligd microbestand van het Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek-CBS. Beveiligde micro-bestanden zijn bestanden die zodanig bewerkt zijn dat herkenning van individuen en huishoudens uitgesloten is.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Business and Management","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Economics"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"CBS BMB"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1984-01-01"},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-09-17"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1984-01-01"}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Centraal Bureau voor de Statistiek"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D70000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D61000"],"expanded